            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Fixed local web Second Opinion routing so a fresh chat adopts its parent session before any nested Council-member frame can create a competing session row: the harness now captures `SessionReady` alongside pre-ready subagent frames and the orchestrator replays them in order to every subscriber.",
